   "text": "Kimahri knows this one. And this one.",
   "portrait": "kimahri.png",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 1
  },
  {
   "ms": 15544,
   "lastMs": 17145,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "They held the gate. All of them.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 2
  },
  {
   "ms": 17179,
   "lastMs": 19095,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "For you, Lady Yuna.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 3
  },
  {
   "ms": 19211,
   "lastMs": 19211,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "Late, Ronso. They called your name.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 4
  },
  {
   "ms": 19227,
   "lastMs": 19245,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "You were on the wrong side of the mountain.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 5
  },
  {
   "ms": 19262,
   "lastMs": 19262,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Wakka",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "You did this? To them?",
   "portrait": "wakka.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 6
  },
  {
   "ms": 19278,
   "lastMs": 19278,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "They refused comfort. I offered it anyway.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 7
  },
  {
   "ms": 19296,
   "lastMs": 19296,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Tidus",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "That's not comfort. That's a pile of bodies.",
   "portrait": "tidus.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 8
  },
  {
   "ms": 19312,
   "lastMs": 19312,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "Ah. The son of Jecht.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 9
  },
  {
   "ms": 19327,
   "lastMs": 19327,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "You talk about him when you think no one listens.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 10
  },
  {
   "ms": 19345,
   "lastMs": 19345,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "So let me give you what no one else will.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 11
  },
  {
   "ms": 19362,
   "lastMs": 19379,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "Your father is Sin.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 12
  },
  {
   "ms": 19395,
   "lastMs": 19411,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Tidus",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "...You're lying.",
   "portrait": "tidus.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 13
  },
  {
   "ms": 19428,
   "lastMs": 19445,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Tidus",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "Auron. Tell him he's lying.",
   "portrait": "tidus.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 14
  },
  {
   "ms": 19461,
   "lastMs": 19461,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "Kill Sin, and you free him.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 15
  },
  {
   "ms": 19478,
   "lastMs": 19478,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "I am offering you your father back.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 16
  },
  {
   "ms": 19496,
   "lastMs": 19512,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Yuna",
   "role": "Summoner",
   "text": "No.",
   "portrait": "yuna.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 17
  },
  {
   "ms": 19528,
   "lastMs": 19528,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Yuna",
   "role": "Summoner",
   "text": "You don't get to hand me a reason.",
   "portrait": "yuna.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 18
  },
  {
   "ms": 19545,
   "lastMs": 19545,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Tidus",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "He's not a bargaining chip. He's my old man.",
   "portrait": "tidus.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 19
  },
  {
   "ms": 19562,
   "lastMs": 19562,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Lulu",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "Yuna. Don't listen.",
   "portrait": "lulu.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 20
  },
  {
   "ms": 19578,
   "lastMs": 19578,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Lulu",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "He talks to keep you standing still.",
   "portrait": "lulu.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 21
  },
  {
   "ms": 19595,
   "lastMs": 19595,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "Spira is a wound that will not close.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 22
  },
  {
   "ms": 19616,
   "lastMs": 19627,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "I am the bandage.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 23
  },
  {
   "ms": 19645,
   "lastMs": 19662,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Yuna",
   "role": "Summoner",
   "text": "No. Not this time.",
   "portrait": "yuna.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 24
  },
  {
   "ms": 19694,
   "lastMs": 19694,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "Then your hope ends here.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 25
  },
  {
   "ms": 19712,
   "lastMs": 19786,
   "screen": "cutscene",
   "speaker": "Auron",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "Enough talk. Move.",
   "portrait": "auron.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 26,
   "endMs": 19786
  },
  {
   "ms": 49312,
   "lastMs": 50528,
   "screen": "battle",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "Let it in.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 27
  },
  {
   "ms": 50561,
   "lastMs": 52594,
   "screen": "battle",
   "speaker": "Seymour",
   "role": "Maester",
   "text": "It's quieter on the other side.",
   "portrait": "seymour.webp",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 28,
   "endMs": 52594
  },
  {
   "ms": 65744,
   "lastMs": 67444,
   "screen": "battle",
   "speaker": "Kimahri",
   "role": "Guardian",
   "text": "Yuna. Do not heal him.",
   "portrait": "kimahri.png",
   "narrate": false,
   "show": 29
  },
  {
   "ms": 67477,
   "lastMs": 69778,
   "screen": "battle",
   "speaker": "Yuna",
   "role": "Summoner",
   "text": "He's turned. A cure would hurt him now.",
   "portrait": "yuna.webp",
   "narrate": false,
